{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMTEC : Your Partner in Profitable Deep Space Ventures</strong><br>As a freelance Prospector, you\u2019ve chosen COMTEC to supply you with what you need. <i>COMTEC, the galaxy\u2019s #1 comet-coloniser</i>. Your goal? To buy a comet, extract its resources and build a destination for tourists, hoping to make your money back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/extras/19cbb02d4e1b48b00745c17ce4790643.poster.avif?t=1768263176\" width=614 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/extras/19cbb02d4e1b48b00745c17ce4790643.webm?t=1768263176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/extras/19cbb02d4e1b48b00745c17ce4790643.mp4?t=1768263176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/extras/f8bc6f80a853cdf85e6a80d4dac55938.webp?t=1768263176\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land on procedurally generated comets, categorised from Common to Exotic. Harvest raw materials, process them into valuable products, and keep your production chains running, your workers alive and you might keep everyone alive long enough to escape with those credits.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/extras/9cedb5997fc865ad2377effa312932f6.poster.avif?t=1768263176\" width=614 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/extras/9cedb5997fc865ad2377effa312932f6.webm?t=1768263176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/extras/9cedb5997fc865ad2377effa312932f6.mp4?t=1768263176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/extras/56379514d2658538f2faf6654a3d3019.webp?t=1768263176\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As word spreads of your comet, space tourists and those just passing by may land; seeking shelter, snacks, or perhaps just a place to breathe. Build facilities to keep them alive (while they have creds). Entertain them with facilities like the Arquaid,  satisfy their thirst at your bar, or perhaps they desperately need your oxygen. But in space, air isn't free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workers will try to look after the essentials but they too need oxygen and food just like real people. But hey, with enough credits maybe drones will be a better choice. What drone has ever needed food and sleep?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/extras/84293d2ea750b03f9addd25841a4866e.poster.avif?t=1768263176\" width=614 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/extras/84293d2ea750b03f9addd25841a4866e.webm?t=1768263176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/extras/84293d2ea750b03f9addd25841a4866e.mp4?t=1768263176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/extras/1117634de93e0dfba1d8aee3819f7e7e.webp?t=1768263176\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract resources and build the infrastructure to process new products on procedurally generated comets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for the human workers that try to run your operation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cater to space travelling visitors with food, facilities, and entertainment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the resource demand visitors put on you (ethically or otherwise)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade workers and facilities to speed up production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn enough creds to buy the rights to bigger and better comets</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763050?t=1768263176","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/893278c25ef39f72b512756ac35b571b2e70e043/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768263176","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/2386dae77e2e6099f7a09801c2e1658ee522dd7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768263176","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/2386dae77e2e6099f7a09801c2e1658ee522dd7e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768263176","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4054610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMTEC : Your Partner in Profitable Deep Space Ventures</strong><br>As a freelance Prospector, you\u2019ve chosen COMTEC to supply you with what you need. <i>COMTEC, the galaxy\u2019s #1 comet-coloniser</i>. Your goal? To buy a comet, extract its resources and build a destination for tourists, hoping to make your money back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/extras/19cbb02d4e1b48b00745c17ce4790643.poster.avif?t=1768263176\" width=614 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/extras/19cbb02d4e1b48b00745c17ce4790643.webm?t=1768263176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/extras/19cbb02d4e1b48b00745c17ce4790643.mp4?t=1768263176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/extras/f8bc6f80a853cdf85e6a80d4dac55938.webp?t=1768263176\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land on procedurally generated comets, categorised from Common to Exotic. Harvest raw materials, process them into valuable products, and keep your production chains running, your workers alive and you might keep everyone alive long enough to escape with those credits.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/extras/9cedb5997fc865ad2377effa312932f6.poster.avif?t=1768263176\" width=614 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/extras/9cedb5997fc865ad2377effa312932f6.webm?t=1768263176\" type=\