19f7e7e.webp?t=1768263176\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract resources and build the infrastructure to process new products on procedurally generated comets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for the human workers that try to run your operation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cater to space travelling visitors with food, facilities, and entertainment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the resource demand visitors put on you (ethically or otherwise)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade workers and facilities to speed up production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn enough creds to buy the rights to bigger and better comets</p></li></ul>","developers":["CalmFrantix"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763050/2f9ff5ec7957302cbd7abad81a8001c313669448/header.jpg?t=1768263176","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 CalmFrantix. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3763050/1386549232/82fb840fee3c5f1ce9d55578b5e5e8e80027220a/1759090172/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759090589","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3763050/1386549232/82fb840fee3c5f1ce9d55578b5e5e8e80027220a/1759090172/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759090589","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3763050/1386549232/82fb840fee3c5f1ce9d55578b5e5e8e80027220a/1759090172/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759090589","id":257179766,"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":